How Ceramic Coating Durability Depends on More Than Price
Ceramic coating durability comes down to how the coating bonds with your paint and how well it's looked after afterward. It's not a single fixed number but a range that depends on a few key factors.
Product quality: professional-grade coatings bond more effectively
Application process: proper paint correction before coating matters
Driving conditions: frequent sun exposure or rough roads can wear it faster
Maintenance routine: gentle washing habits help the coating last longer
